{%- comment -%}
  Bush Riding product hero (option 1g — editorial). Full-bleed product-in-
  action photograph with the product title low in the frame — the same
  full-bleed language as the home hero and statement, doing the visual work so
  the buy block below the fold (main-product) can stay lean: text and a
  bordered buy card, no second gallery.

  It used to draw its own wordmark + Explore bar across the top of the
  photograph. The site header is fixed above it, so that put two wordmarks and
  two Explores on the screen, 76px apart. The header is the header; this band
  is a photograph and a title.

  Sits above `main` in templates/product.json; only makes sense on the
  product template, so it always reads from the `product` object.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign tagline = section.settings.tagline
  if tagline == blank and product.description != blank
    assign tagline = product.description | strip_html | truncate: 140
  endif
-%}

<section class="alp alp-phero">
  <div class="alp-phero__media">
    {%- if section.settings.image != blank -%}
      {{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 2400 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', alt: section.settings.image.alt | default: '' }}
    {%- elsif product.featured_image != blank -%}
      {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 2400 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', alt: '' }}
    {%- else -%}
      <img src="{{ 'alpine-ph-hero.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="800" height="1000" loading="eager"
        data-asset-note="Full-bleed product-in-action photograph — the rider wearing/using this product on the trail">
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  <div class="alp-phero__caption">
    <h1 class="alp-phero__title">{{ product.title | escape }}</h1>
    {%- if tagline != blank -%}<p class="alp-phero__tagline">{{ tagline | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Bush Riding product hero",
  "tag": "div",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Full-bleed band above the buy block. Falls back to the product's featured image, then a placeholder, if no image is set here." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Image", "info": "Leave blank to use the product's featured image." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tagline", "label": "One-line tagline", "info": "Leave blank to use the start of the product description." }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Bush Riding product hero" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
